From: PS5_Proton
Subject: [PATCH] user32: route ordinary caption buttons through the theme hook

Ordinary close/minimize/maximize buttons bypass the existing nonclient theme
callback and always paint classic Marlett/3D controls. Reuse that callback for
ordinary captions too; use Window parts when defined and retain the classic
fallback for missing/disabled themes. The callback layout is unchanged, so the
existing PE32/PE64 crossing carries the new enum values without another ABI.

--- a/include/winuser.h
+++ b/include/winuser.h
@@ -4859,6 +4859,11 @@
     MENU_MAX_BUTTON,                 /* Menu max button */
     MENU_RESTORE_BUTTON,             /* Menu restore button */
     MENU_HELP_BUTTON,                /* Menu help button */
+    CAPTION_CLOSE_BUTTON,
+    CAPTION_MIN_BUTTON,
+    CAPTION_MAX_BUTTON,
+    CAPTION_RESTORE_BUTTON,
+    CAPTION_SMALL_CLOSE_BUTTON,
 };
 
